  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<div>This information is used  to manage oil and gas rights on offshore Crown lands in Ontario.<br />\nA grid system of blocks and tracts is used to divide the area.<br />\n1 block =  5 minute longitude by 5 minute latitude numbered area.<br />\n1 tract =  1 minute longitude by 1 minute latitude area, assigned by letters.<br />\n1 block contains 25 tracts.</div>\n<div><br /></div>\n<div><strong>Additional Documentation<br /></strong> </div>\n<div><ul>\n<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Petroleum Crown Lake Grid - Documentation.docx' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Petroleum Crown Lake Grid - Documentation</a></li>\n<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Petroleum%20Crown%20Lake%20Grid%20-%20Data%20Description.pdf' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Petroleum Crown Lake Grid - Data Description</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div><br /></div>\n<div> <strong>Status</strong></div>\n<div>Completed: production of the data has been completed</div>\n<div><br /></div>\n<div> <strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency</strong> </div>\n<div>Not planned: there are no plans to update the data</div>\n<div><br /></div>\n<div> <strong>Contact<br /> </strong> </div>\n<div>Ryan Sitch, Regional Operations Division, <a href='mailto:ryan.sitch@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'> ryan.sitch@ontario.ca</a></div>"
